{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","牧魂人"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","贮存1名友军的灵魂，使其在遭受最后一击后，能以“灵魂形态”继续战斗。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","尼汝对1名友军释放咒语。这名友军受到最后一击后，不会被击败，生命值恢复至最大生命值的45%，并进入“灵魂形态”。“灵魂形态”下的角色可以继续照常战斗，但只能造成45% + 5%的伤害，每秒失去生命值，并且失去生命值的速度逐渐提升，直至耗尽后将被彻底击败。本技能优先选择最虚弱的友军作为目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":83,"end":88,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fatal"},{"start":134,"end":138,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每累计有1名（至多为5）除召唤物以外敌人被击败，被本技能施加咒语的角色在进入“灵魂形态”时额外恢复10%最大生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每当有除召唤物以外敌人被击败时，处于“灵魂形态”的角色立即恢复10%最大生命值（每名角色至多因此恢复5次）。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“灵魂形态”下的英雄造成的伤害提升至55% + 5%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":26,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“灵魂形态”下的英雄造成的伤害提升至65% + 5%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":26,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","灵魂收割"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对最虚弱的1名敌人造成伤害，目标生命值越低则伤害越高。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","尼汝对最虚弱的1名敌人造成120% + 20% ATK伤害，并额外造成其当前损失的生命值的0.3倍的伤害（额外伤害不超过450% ATK）。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":3,"end":7,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","额外造成其当前损失的生命值的0.35倍的伤害（额外伤害不超过525% ATK）。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","额外造成其当前损失的生命值的0.4倍的伤害（额外伤害不超过600% ATK）。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","额外造成其当前损失的生命值的0.45倍的伤害（额外伤害不超过600% ATK）。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","吞灵汲命"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","抽取所有敌人的生命力，治疗最虚弱的友军。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","尼汝抽取所有敌人的生命力，对每名敌人造成150% + 15% ATK伤害，额外附带目标最大生命值3%的伤害（不超过70% ATK），并使最虚弱的友军恢复等同于伤害数额的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":57,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对每名敌人造成的伤害提升至160% + 15% ATK，额外附带最大生命值3.5%的伤害（不超过80% ATK）。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对每名敌人造成的伤害提升至170% + 15% ATK，额外附带最大生命值4%的伤害（不超过90% ATK）。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对每名敌人造成的伤害提升至180% + 15% ATK，额外附带最大生命值5%的伤害（不超过100% ATK）。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身生命值。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升17%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升23%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命值提升29%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","灵魂之身"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","在战斗开始时不消耗能量释放终极技能。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，尼汝不消耗能量对最近的友军释放终极技能，优先以自己身后的友军作为目标。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","进入“灵魂形态”的英雄不会随着时间失去生命值，直至我方所有友军累计处于“灵魂形态”形态8秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","直至我方所有友军累计处于“灵魂形态”形态10秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","直至我方所有友军累计处于“灵魂形态”形态12秒。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“灵魂收割”使敌人一段时间无法恢复生命。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“灵魂收割”还能使敌人在8秒内无法恢复生命。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击替换为“吞灵汲命”，且造成的伤害下降至原来的75%。当“吞灵汲命”对雪米拉或戴蒙产生治疗时，还会使其提升60%的护甲和魔抗，持续8秒。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","收割之镰"]]}